    end

    LIB <-->|"HTTPS / HTML Forms:<br/>Catalog & Copy CRUD, Member Mgmt,<br/>Desk Checkout/Return, Fine & Lost-Book<br/>Settlement, Dashboard & CSV Export"| WEB
