    GST -->|"HTTPS GET (Read-Only):<br/>Browse & Search Public Catalog,<br/>Check Copy Availability"| WEB

    OL -.->|"1. Offline data-prep time only<br/>(>= 1.2s polite rate limit)"| FETCH
    FETCH -.->|"2. Generates deterministic<br/>JSON snapshots"| SEED_FILES
    WEB -.->|"Optional Could-Have (C2):<br/>Live ISBN lookup with<br/>offline fallback"| OL
